#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "Bezplatný kurz IBM o kvantové informaci a výpočtech"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analýza"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we'll analyze Grover's algorithm to understand how it works.\n"
"We'll start with what could be described as a *symbolic* analysis, where we calculate how the Grover operation $G$ acts on certain states, and then we'll tie this symbolic analysis to a *geometric* picture that's helpful for visualizing how the algorithm works.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nyní provedeme analýzu Groverova algoritmu, abychom pochopili, jak funguje.\n"
"Začneme tím, co by se dalo popsat jako *symbolická* analýza, kde vypočítáme, jak Groverova operace $G$ působí na určité stavy, a poté tuto symbolickou analýzu propojíme s *geometrickým* obrázkem, který je užitečný pro vizualizaci fungování algoritmu.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Solutions and non-solutions {#solutions-and-non-solutions}"
msgstr "Řešení a neřešení {#solutions-and-non-solutions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Let's start by defining two sets of strings.\n"
msgstr "Začněme definováním dvou množin řetězců.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  A_0 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 0\\bigr\\} \\\\\n"
"  A_1 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 1\\bigr\\}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  A_0 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 0\\bigr\\} \\\\\n"
"  A_1 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 1\\bigr\\}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The set $A_1$ contains all of the solutions to our search problem while $A_0$ contains the strings that aren't solutions (which we can refer to as *non-solutions* when it's convenient).\n"
"These two sets satisfy $A_0 \\cap A_1 = \\varnothing$ and $A_0 \\cup A_1 = \\Sigma^n,$ which is to say that this is a *bipartition* of $\\Sigma^n.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Množina $A_1$ obsahuje všechna řešení našeho vyhledávacího problému, zatímco $A_0$ obsahuje řetězce, které nejsou řešeními (můžeme je označovat jako *neřešení*, když se to hodí).\n"
"Tyto dvě množiny splňují $A_0 \\cap A_1 = \\varnothing$ a $A_0 \\cup A_1 = \\Sigma^n,$ což znamená, že jde o *bipartici* množiny $\\Sigma^n.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next we'll define two unit vectors representing uniform superpositions over "
"the sets of solutions and non-solutions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dále definujeme dva jednotkové vektory reprezentující rovnoměrné superpozice"
" přes množiny řešení a neřešení.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert A_0\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_0} \\vert x\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  \\vert A_1\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_1} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert A_0\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_0} \\vert x\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  \\vert A_1\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_1} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Formally speaking, each of these vectors is only defined when its corresponding set is nonempty, but hereafter we're going to focus on the case that neither $A_0$ nor $A_1$ is empty.\n"
"The cases that $A_0 = \\varnothing$ and $A_1 = \\varnothing$ are easily handled separately, and we'll do that later.\n"
msgstr ""
"Formálně vzato, každý z těchto vektorů je definován pouze tehdy, když odpovídající množina je neprázdná, ale dále se budeme soustředit na případ, kdy ani $A_0$ ani $A_1$ není prázdná.\n"
"Případy $A_0 = \\varnothing$ a $A_1 = \\varnothing$ se dají snadno řešit zvlášť, a to uděláme později.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As an aside, the notation being used here is common: any time we have a "
"finite and nonempty set $S,$ we can write $\\vert S\\rangle$ to denote the "
"quantum state vector that's uniform over the elements of $S.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Mimochodem, zde používaná notace je běžná: kdykoli máme konečnou a "
"neprázdnou množinu $S,$ můžeme zapsat $\\vert S\\rangle$ pro označení "
"kvantového stavového vektoru, který je rovnoměrný přes prvky $S.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's also define $\\vert u \\rangle$ to be a *uniform* quantum state over "
"all $n$-bit strings:\n"
msgstr ""
"Definujme také $\\vert u \\rangle$ jako *rovnoměrný* kvantový stav přes "
"všechny $n$-bitové řetězce:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{N}} \\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n} \\vert x\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{N}} \\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n} \\vert x\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Notice that\n"
msgstr "Všimni si, že\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We also have that $\\vert u\\rangle = H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle,$ "
"so $\\vert u\\rangle$ represents the state of the register $\\mathsf{Q}$ "
"after the initialization in step 1 of Grover's algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"Také platí $\\vert u\\rangle = H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle,$ takže "
"$\\vert u\\rangle$ reprezentuje stav registru $\\mathsf{Q}$ po inicializaci "
"v kroku 1 Groverova algoritmu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This implies that just before the iterations of $G$ happen in step 2, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ is contained in the two-dimensional vector space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$ and moreover the coefficients of these vectors are real numbers.\n"
"As we will see, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ will always have these properties — meaning that the state is a real linear combination of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ — after any number of iterations of the operation $G$ in step 2.\n"
msgstr ""
"To znamená, že těsně před tím, než v kroku 2 proběhnou iterace $G$, je stav $\\mathsf{Q}$ obsažen ve dvoudimenzionálním vektorovém prostoru generovaném vektory $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ a $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, a navíc koeficienty těchto vektorů jsou reálná čísla.\n"
"Jak uvidíme, stav $\\mathsf{Q}$ bude mít tyto vlastnosti vždy — tedy že stav je reálnou lineární kombinací $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ a $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ — po libovolném počtu iterací operace $G$ v kroku 2.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An observation about the Grover operation {#an-observation-about-the-grover-"
"operation}"
msgstr ""
"Pozorování o Groverově operaci {#an-observation-about-the-grover-operation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We'll now turn our attention to the Grover operation\n"
msgstr "Nyní obrátíme pozornost ke Groverově operaci\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "beginning with an interesting observation about it.\n"
msgstr "a začneme zajímavým pozorováním o ní.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Imagine for a moment that we replaced the function $f$ by the composition of $f$ with the NOT function — or, in other words, the function we get by flipping the output bit of $f.$\n"
"We'll call this new function $g,$ and we can express it using symbols in a few alternative ways.\n"
msgstr ""
"Představ si na chvíli, že bychom funkci $f$ nahradili složením $f$ s funkcí NOT — jinými slovy funkcí, kterou dostaneme převrácením výstupního bitu $f.$\n"
"Tuto novou funkci nazveme $g$ a můžeme ji zapsat pomocí symbolů několika alternativními způsoby.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"g(x) = \\neg f(x) = 1 \\oplus f(x) = 1 - f(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & f(x) = 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & f(x) = 1\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"g(x) = \\neg f(x) = 1 \\oplus f(x) = 1 - f(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & f(x) = 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & f(x) = 1\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(-1)^{g(x)} = (-1)^{1 \\oplus f(x)} = - (-1)^{f(x)}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(-1)^{g(x)} = (-1)^{1 \\oplus f(x)} = - (-1)^{f(x)}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for every string $x\\in\\Sigma^n,$ and therefore\n"
msgstr "pro každý řetězec $x\\in\\Sigma^n,$ a proto\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_g = - Z_f.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_g = - Z_f.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This means that if we were to substitute the function $f$ with the function "
"$g,$ Grover's algorithm wouldn't function any differently — because the "
"states we obtain from the algorithm in the two cases are necessarily "
"equivalent up to a global phase.\n"
msgstr ""
"To znamená, že kdybychom funkci $f$ nahradili funkcí $g$, Groverův "
"algoritmus by fungoval úplně stejně — protože stavy, které z algoritmu "
"získáme v obou případech, jsou nutně ekvivalentní až na globální fázi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This isn't a problem!\n"
"Intuitively speaking, the algorithm doesn't care which strings are solutions and which are non-solutions — it only needs to be able to *distinguish* solutions and non-solutions to operate correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"To není problém!\n"
"Intuitivně řečeno, algoritmu je jedno, které řetězce jsou řešení a které neřešení — potřebuje pouze umět *rozlišit* řešení od neřešení, aby fungoval správně.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Action of the Grover operation {#action-of-the-grover-operation}"
msgstr "Působení Groverovy operace {#action-of-the-grover-operation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's consider the action of $G$ on the quantum state vectors $\\vert "
"A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Nyní se podívejme na působení $G$ na kvantové stavové vektory $\\vert "
"A_0\\rangle$ a $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, let's observe that the operation $Z_f$ has a very simple action on "
"$\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Nejprve si všimni, že operace $Z_f$ působí na $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ a $\\vert"
" A_1\\rangle$ velmi jednoduše.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Second, we have the operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"The operation $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ is defined as\n"
msgstr ""
"Za druhé, máme operaci $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"Operace $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ je definována jako\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[2mm]\n"
"-\\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[2mm]\n"
"-\\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"again for every string $x\\in\\Sigma^n,$ and a convenient alternative way to"
" express this operation is like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"opět pro každý řetězec $x\\in\\Sigma^n,$ a pohodlný alternativní způsob, jak"
" tuto operaci vyjádřit, je následující:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} = 2 \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} = 2 \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A simple way to verify that this expression agrees with the definition of "
"$Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ is to evaluate its action on standard basis states.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jednoduchý způsob, jak ověřit, že tento výraz odpovídá definici "
"$Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$, je vyhodnotit jeho působení na stavy standardní báze.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$ can therefore"
" be written like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Operaci $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$ lze proto zapsat "
"takto:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert H^{\\otimes n} - \\mathbb{I} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert H^{\\otimes n} - \\mathbb{I} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"using the same notation, $\\vert u \\rangle,$ that we used above for the "
"uniform superposition over all $n$-bit strings.\n"
msgstr ""
"přičemž používáme stejné označení $\\vert u \\rangle$ jako výše pro "
"uniformní superpozici všech $n$-bitových řetězců.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And now we have what we need to compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"First let's compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_0\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"A nyní máme vše potřebné k výpočtu působení $G$ na $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ a $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"Nejprve vypočítejme působení $G$ na $\\vert A_0\\rangle.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle -\\vert A_0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"  -\\vert A_0 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\biggl( \\frac{2\\vert A_0\\vert}{N} - 1\\biggr) \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle -\\vert A_0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"  -\\vert A_0 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\biggl( \\frac{2\\vert A_0\\vert}{N} - 1\\biggr) \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "And second, let's compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr "A za druhé vypočítejme působení $G$ na $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"      + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr) + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\biggl( 1 - \\frac{2\\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\biggr) \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"      + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr) + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\biggl( 1 - \\frac{2\\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\biggr) \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In both cases we're using the equation\n"
msgstr "V obou případech používáme rovnici\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "along with the expressions\n"
msgstr "spolu s výrazy\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_0\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_1\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_0\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_1\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "that follow.\n"
msgstr "které z ní vyplývají.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In summary, we have\n"
msgstr "Shrnutí:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As we already noted, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ just prior to step 2 is contained in the two-dimensional space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$ and we have just established that $G$ maps any vector in this space to another vector in the same space.\n"
"This means that, for the sake of the analysis, we can focus our attention exclusively on this subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jak jsme si již všimli, stav $\\mathsf{Q}$ těsně před krokem 2 leží v dvourozměrném prostoru generovaném vektory $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ a $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$ a právě jsme ukázali, že $G$ zobrazuje libovolný vektor v tomto prostoru na jiný vektor ve stejném prostoru.\n"
"To znamená, že pro účely analýzy se můžeme soustředit výhradně na tento podprostor.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To better understand what's happening within this two-dimensional space, "
"let's express the action of $G$ on this space as a matrix,\n"
msgstr ""
"Abychom lépe porozuměli tomu, co se v tomto dvourozměrném prostoru děje, "
"vyjádřeme působení $G$ na tento prostor jako matici:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"whose first and second rows/columns correspond to $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$ respectively.\n"
"So far in this series, we've always connected the rows and columns of matrices with the classical states of a system, but matrices can also be used to describe the actions of linear mappings on different bases like we have here.\n"
msgstr ""
"jejíž první a druhý řádek/sloupec odpovídají $\\vert A_0\\rangle$, respektive $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"Dosud jsme v této sérii vždy spojovali řádky a sloupce matic s klasickými stavy systému, ale matice lze použít i k popisu působení lineárních zobrazení v různých bázích, jak to děláme zde.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"While it isn't at all obvious at first glance, the matrix $M$ is what we "
"obtain by *squaring* a simpler-looking matrix.\n"
msgstr ""
"I když to na první pohled vůbec není zřejmé, matice $M$ je to, co získáme "
"*umocněním* jednodušeji vypadající matice.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = M\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = M\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The matrix\n"
msgstr "Matice\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "is a *rotation matrix*, which we can alternatively express as\n"
msgstr "je *rotační matice*, kterou můžeme alternativně vyjádřit jako\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for\n"
msgstr "pro\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\sin^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}}\\biggr).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\sin^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}}\\biggr).\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This angle $\\theta$ is going to play a very important role in the analysis "
"that follows, so it's worth stressing its importance here as we see it for "
"the first time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento úhel $\\theta$ bude hrát velmi důležitou roli v následující analýze, "
"takže stojí za to zdůraznit jeho význam zde, když ho vidíme poprvé.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In light of this expression of this matrix, we observe that\n"
msgstr "Ve světle tohoto vyjádření matice pozorujeme, že\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(2\\theta) & -\\sin(2\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(2\\theta) & \\cos(2\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(2\\theta) & -\\sin(2\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(2\\theta) & \\cos(2\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is because rotating by the angle $\\theta$ two times is equivalent to rotating by the angle $2\\theta.$\n"
"Another way to see this is to make use of the alternative expression\n"
msgstr ""
"Je to proto, že provedení rotace o úhel $\\theta$ dvakrát je ekvivalentní rotaci o úhel $2\\theta.$\n"
"Jiný způsob, jak to nahlédnout, je využít alternativní vyjádření\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\\biggr),\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\\biggr),\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "together with the *double angle* formulas from trigonometry:\n"
msgstr "spolu se vzorci pro *dvojnásobný úhel* z trigonometrie:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\cos(2\\theta) & = \\cos^2(\\theta) - \\sin^2(\\theta)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\sin(2\\theta) & = 2 \\sin(\\theta)\\cos(\\theta).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
"In summary, the state of the register $\\mathsf{Q}$ at the start of step 2 is\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\cos(2\\theta) & = \\cos^2(\\theta) - \\sin^2(\\theta)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\sin(2\\theta) & = 2 \\sin(\\theta)\\cos(\\theta).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
"Shrnutí: stav registru $\\mathsf{Q}$ na začátku kroku 2 je\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"= \\cos(\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"= \\cos(\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and the effect of applying $G$ to this state is to rotate it by an angle $2\\theta$ within the space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"So, for example, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"a efekt aplikace $G$ na tento stav je jeho otočení o úhel $2\\theta$ v prostoru generovaném vektory $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ a $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
"Takže například máme\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"G \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(3\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(3\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^2 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(5\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(5\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^3 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(7\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(7\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"G \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(3\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(3\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^2 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(5\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(5\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^3 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(7\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(7\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and in general\n"
msgstr "a obecně\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"G^t \\vert u \\rangle\n"
"= \\cos\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sin\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"G^t \\vert u \\rangle\n"
"= \\cos\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sin\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Geometric picture {#geometric-picture}"
msgstr "Geometrický obraz {#geometric-picture}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's connect the analysis we just went through to a geometric picture.\n"
"The idea is that the operation $G$ is the product of two *reflections*,\n"
"$Z_f$ and $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"And the net effect of performing two reflections is to perform a *rotation*.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nyní propojme analýzu, kterou jsme právě provedli, s geometrickým obrazem.\n"
"Myšlenka spočívá v tom, že operace $G$ je součinem dvou *zrcadlení* (reflexí),\n"
"$Z_f$ a $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"A výsledný efekt provedení dvou zrcadlení je provedení *rotace*.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's start with $Z_f.$\n"
"As we already observed previously, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Začněme s $Z_f.$\n"
"Jak jsme si již dříve všimli, platí\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within the two-dimensional vector space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle,$\n"
"this is a *reflection* about the line parallel to $\\vert A_0\\rangle,$ which we'll call $L_1.$\n"
"Here's a figure illustrating the action of this reflection on a hypothetical unit vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$\n"
"which we're assuming is a real linear combination of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"V dvourozměrném vektorovém prostoru generovaném vektory $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ a $\\vert A_1\\rangle$\n"
"se jedná o *zrcadlení* kolem přímky rovnoběžné s $\\vert A_0\\rangle,$ kterou nazveme $L_1.$\n"
"Zde je obrázek znázorňující působení tohoto zrcadlení na hypotetický jednotkový vektor $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$\n"
"u kterého předpokládáme, že je reálnou lineární kombinací $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ a $\\vert A_1\\rangle.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A figure depicting the action of a reflection on a "
"vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/reflection1.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Obrázek znázorňující působení zrcadlení na "
"vektor.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/reflection1.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Second we have the operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes "
"n},$ which we've already seen can be written as\n"
msgstr ""
"Za druhé máme operaci $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n},$ o "
"které jsme již viděli, že ji lze zapsat jako\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is also a reflection, this time about the line $L_2$ parallel to the vector $\\vert u\\rangle.$\n"
"Here's a figure depicting the action of this reflection on a unit vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Toto je rovněž zrcadlení, tentokrát kolem přímky $L_2$ rovnoběžné s vektorem $\\vert u\\rangle.$\n"
"Zde je obrázek znázorňující působení tohoto zrcadlení na jednotkový vektor $\\vert\\psi\\rangle.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A figure depicting the action of a second reflection on a "
"vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/reflection2.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Obrázek znázorňující působení druhého zrcadlení na "
"vektor.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/reflection2.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When we compose these two reflections, we obtain a rotation — by twice the "
"angle between the lines of reflection — as this figure illustrates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Když tato dvě zrcadlení složíme, získáme rotaci — o dvojnásobek úhlu mezi "
"osami zrcadlení — jak znázorňuje tento obrázek.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A figure depicting the action of the Grover operation on a "
"vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/Grover_rotation.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Obrázek znázorňující působení Groverovy operace na "
"vektor.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-"
"algorithm/Grover_rotation.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This explains, in geometric terms, why the effect of the Grover operation is"
" to rotate linear combinations of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert "
"A_1\\rangle$ by an angle of $2\\theta.$\n"
msgstr ""
